node_modules/
dist/
.sst/
.env
*.db
# SQLite's working files, left beside a database when the server stops without closing it
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.log
# The search models download into models/Xenova/ beside the index, wherever a relative
# INDEX_DB_PATH puts it; matching Xenova/ leaves any source folder named models/ tracked
**/models/Xenova/
# The dev commands in README.md and CONTRIBUTING.md keep the index, OAuth state and models here
/.data/
CLAUDE.local.md
.serena/
# .claude/ is local state except the committed session hooks (a trailing-slash
# dir ignore would block the re-includes — git never descends into ignored dirs)
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
.claude/hooks/*
!.claude/hooks/install-deps.sh
!.claude/hooks/prepare-command.sh
TASKS.md
.DS_Store

